907 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 908 0 R/Alt(Two scatter plots side by side with a shared vertical axis, achieved over target in decibels, against one-third-octave band centre from 20 Hz to 2 kHz on a log axis. Control gauges are blue open circles and held-out gauges are orange open triangles, set side by side in each band; dotted lines mark 6 dB either side of the target. Left panel, six shakers and twelve control gauges: both groups scatter about zero, mostly within 10 dB, with a few bands far off either way. Right panel, six shakers and six control gauges: every blue circle lies on the zero line, while the orange triangles spread widely, most of them above zero.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1970 0 R>>
endobj
