912 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 913 0 R/Alt(A cumulative plot. The horizontal axis is element RMS stress on the shakers over its RMS stress in service, in decibels. The vertical axis is the share of elements at or below, from 0 to 100 percent. A gray band marks within 3 dB of service. A blue solid line with open circles, six shakers and twelve control gauges, lies mostly inside the gray band. An orange dashed line with open triangles, six shakers and six control gauges, lies mostly to the right of the band.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[4]/Pg 1970 0 R>>
endobj
