1088 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1089 0 R/Alt(Two scatter plots side by side against the small-signal frequency of each mode, 70 Hz to 2 kHz on a log axis. Left panel, frequency change in percent: about 74 article modes fall by 0 to 9 percent; for most of them a filled blue circle (as tested) sits on or very near an open orange triangle (reference drive), with some spread above about 400 Hz; a dashed blue line at about -3 percent marks the median in service. At about 111 Hz the member's mode is above zero: a green star at about +2.1 percent, an open orange diamond at about +2.9 percent and an open black square at about +1.7 percent. Right panel, damping over its small-signal value, from 1 to 6: the article modes again pair circles with triangles, mostly between 2.5 and 6, with a dashed line at about 3 for the median in service; the member's star is at about 2.0, its diamond at about 2.1 and its square at about 1.6.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[52]/Pg 1973 0 R>>
endobj
